<div class="architecture" id="software-architecture">
  <h3>Hardware Motion Pipeline</h3>
  <ol class="flow" aria-label="Hardware motion pipeline, in order">
    <li><strong>Joint Trajectories</strong><span>Keyframes + interpolation</span></li>
    <li><strong>Python Launcher</strong><span>Calibration + execution checks</span></li>
    <li><strong>Dual CAN</strong><span>100 Hz host commands</span></li>
    <li><strong>CyberGear Motors</strong><span>Internal actuator control</span></li>
  </ol>
  <p>Motor feedback returns over CAN to the launcher and run logger.</p>
  <h3>ROS 2 Supervisory Layer</h3>
  <ol class="flow supervisory" aria-label="ROS 2 supervisory data path, in order">
    <li><strong>State Inputs</strong><span>Motor state + calibration + power status</span></li>
    <li><strong>Safety Supervisor</strong><span>Readiness + latched faults</span></li>
    <li><strong>Command Gate</strong><span>Joint limits + freshness + sequence</span></li>
    <li><strong>Bounded Commands</strong><span>ROS 2 output for integration</span></li>
  </ol>
</div>

